/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:314:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:315:Fill the background under a top-row red/grey span with a shrinking diagonal pattern that alternates red and grey.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:316:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:317:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:318:- The grid has an orange background.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:319:- All foreground pixels are red or grey and lie on the top row.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:320:- The first and last top-row foreground pixels define an odd-width span.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:321:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:322:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:323:- Copy the input grid.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:324:- For row r below the top, fill columns span_left + r through span_right - r.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:325:- Each filled cell takes the top-row color r columns up-left, flipped red<->grey once per row step.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:326:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:327:Key insight:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:328:- The output is the top-row span propagated down-right along diagonals, while the allowable region shrinks inward from both ends each row.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:329:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:330:</reference_puzzle>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:331:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:332:<reference_puzzle index="18" source="train" puzzle_id="34cfa167" lines="94-117">
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:333:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:334:Complete a four-corner framed rectangle from one decorated anchor rectangle and its diagonal mate.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:335:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:336:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:337:- The background is the dominant color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:338:- Two same-color solid rectangular anchors of the same size sit on opposite
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:339:  diagonal corners, with the first anchor above-left of the second.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:340:- The upper-left anchor has two one-cell-thick vertical control bars to its
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:341:  right and two one-cell-thick horizontal control bars below it.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:342:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:343:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:344:- Copy the anchor rectangle into the two missing corners of the implied
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:345:  larger rectangle.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:346:- Repeat the right-side control bars horizontally between the left and right
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:347:  anchors, using their spacing as the period, and draw the outer top and
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:348:  bottom borders in the first right-control color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:349:- Repeat the below-side control bars vertically between the top and bottom
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:350:  anchors, using the same period, and draw the outer left and right borders
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:351:  in the first below-control color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:352:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:353:Key insight: The small control bars are the first two ticks of two periodic
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:354:frame patterns; the diagonal anchor supplies the opposite corner and the
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:355:missing two anchor copies.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:356:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:357:</reference_puzzle>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:358:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:359:<reference_puzzle index="19" source="train" puzzle_id="a834deea" lines="20-39">
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:360:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:361:Fill each black 5x5 region's missing interior positions with a fixed 3x3 positional color legend.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:362:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:363:Input structure
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:364:- The grid uses teal as the dominant background and black for one or more
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:365:  5x5 regions.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:366:- Each black region has a black one-pixel border and a 3x3 interior that
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:367:  may already contain teal pixels.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:368:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:369:Rule
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:370:- Overlay the legend 1 7 6 / 4 8 5 / 2 9 3 on the 3x3 interior of every
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:371:  5x5 black region.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:372:- Wherever an interior non-center legend position is still black, recolor it
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:373:  to the corresponding legend color; leave existing teal pixels, the center,
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:374:  and the black border unchanged.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:375:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:376:Key insight
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:377:- The colored output pixels are not derived from the teal motif shape; they
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:378:  are the fixed position labels for the missing cells of each 3x3 interior.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:379:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:380:</reference_puzzle>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:381:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:382:<reference_puzzle index="20" source="train" puzzle_id="5792cb4d" lines="44-59">
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:383:<description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:384:Reverse the sequence of colors along the single 4-connected foreground path while keeping the path shape fixed.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:385:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:386:Input structure:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:387:- The background is the dominant color.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:388:- All non-background pixels form one multicolor 4-connected one-pixel-wide path.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:389:- The path has exactly two endpoints and no branches.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:390:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:391:Rule:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:392:- Walk the path from one endpoint to the other.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:393:- Replace the colors on those same path cells by the original path colors in reverse order.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:394:- Leave every background pixel unchanged.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:395:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:396:Key insight:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:397:- Nothing moves geometrically; only the color string written on the path is reversed between the endpoints.
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:398:</description>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:399:</reference_puzzle>
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/des/seed1107365848/10/prompt.md:400:
